            "years": [
              2018,
              2022,
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For Over $100K, transactions-received-per-household was 119.6 pieces per household per year in FY2023, decreasing from 130.0 pieces per household per year in FY2022 and down from 171.6 pieces per household per year in FY2018.",
